## Control {{controlId}}: Control Connection of Mobile Devices

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

This organization establishes usage restrictions, configuration requirements, connection requirements, and implementation guidance for organization-controlled mobile devices within the {{tenantName}} M365 GCC High tenant. Mobile device management is enforced through Microsoft Intune enrollment policies, app protection policies, and Conditional Access device compliance requirements.

{{#if deviceConfigurationsActive}}
Intune mobile device management enforces connection controls through {{deviceConfigurationsCount}} device configuration policies. All mobile devices must be enrolled in Intune and verified compliant before accessing CUI resources. Configuration policies enforce: device encryption, minimum OS version, PIN/biometric lock, jailbreak/root detection, and approved application lists. Non-compliant devices are blocked from accessing organizational resources.
{{else}}
Intune mobile device enrollment and configuration policies have not been configured. Mobile device controls rely on manual verification pending MDM deployment.
{{/if}}

{{#if appProtectionsActive}}
{{appProtectionsCount}} app protection policies enforce data protection on mobile devices. Policies prevent CUI data leakage through: copy/paste restrictions to unmanaged applications, "Save As" blocks to personal storage, and screen capture prevention for CUI-classified content.
{{/if}}

{{#if policies}}
Conditional Access policies enforce mobile device compliance:
{{#each policies}}
- **{{displayName}}** ({{state}}): Requires {{#each grantControls.builtInControls}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}} for mobile access.
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

{{#if infraResources}}
Supporting infrastructure:
{{#each infraResources}}
- {{resourceType}} "{{name}}"{{#if properties.retention_days}} (retention: {{properties.retention_days}} days){{/if}}
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

**Responsible Party:** {{variables.accessControlAdministrator}}

**Verification Method:** Review Intune device enrollment status, compliance policy configurations, app protection policy settings, and device compliance reports for mobile device fleet.

